    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17750" root="زعب" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُعْبَةٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَعْبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A part,</i> or <i>portion, that is given,</i>
of property, or wealth; (S, K; *) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِعْبٌ</span></b> :
(K:) or <i>a full,</i> or <i>an ample,</i> or <i>abundant, portion, that is given,</i> thereof; and so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زُهْبَةٌ</span>. (TA.)
[See 1, last sentence but one.]

